<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Rocket League – Advanced Movement Training</Major>
    <Description>This macro is designed for Rocket League players who want to combine advanced movement techniques without constant manual input.
It executes a sequence that simulates a wavedash combined with powerslide and boost, allowing you to chain quick recoveries and sharp turns.
Perfect for Free Play warmups or training muscle memory for aerial recoveries and fast directional changes.
It’s fully automated, loops seamlessly, and requires only a keyboard and mouse. No extra setup is necessary.</Description>
    <Comment>Tested in Free Play with keyboard and mouse. Works smoothly and gives a realistic feel for practicing advanced movement combos.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 44 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 80 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 120 ms
KeyUp 225 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 15 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 300 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyUp 225 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 100 ms
GoWhile 1 999</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rocket League</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>